es size and contour compactness, aiding robust classification.\n\ndf['COMPACTNESS_ELONGATEDNESS_CROSS'] = df['COMPACTNESS'] * df['ELONGATEDNESS']", "# DISTANCE_SCATTER_CROSS\n# Product of DISTANCE_CIRCULARITY and SCATTER_RATIO, linking spatial distribution with inertia balance.\n# Usefulness: Effectively distinguishes between symmetrical and asymmetrical spatial distribution, separating compact vehicles (e.g., Opel) from others.\n\ndf['DISTANCE_SCATTER_CROSS'] = df['DISTANCE_CIRCULARITY'] * df['SCATTER_RATIO']", "df.drop(columns=['SCALED_RADIUS_OF_GYRATION'], inplace=True)", "df.drop(columns=['KURTOSIS_ABOUT_MAJOR_AXIS'], inplace=True)", "df.drop(columns=['SKEWNESS_ABOUT_MINOR_AXIS'], inplace=True)"]
